# Delivery lifecycle

Every feature follows this order: Problem, Requirements, Technical design, GitHub issue, Implementation branch, Tests, Pull request, Review, Merge, Release.

A pull request description includes:

- Problem being solved
- Technical implementation
- Architectural implications
- Testing performed
- Screenshots or recordings when the UI changes
- Breaking changes, or an explicit statement that there are none

The agent hands that description over with the bash. The maintainer opens the pull request.
